OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, strikes were reported
OL,8,Fovernight in both countries, with four
OL,9,Fpeople injured in the Ukrainian city of
OL,10,FOdesa and Russia saying drone strikes
OL,11,Fhit an industrial complex east of
OL,12,FMoscow
